      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "Secondary action, e.g. Export to Excel.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outline\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M12 15V3\"/></svg>Export Excel</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outline{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--background,#f3f5ef);color:var(--accent-foreground,#1d4a30);border:1px solid var(--input,#c6d0bf);height:34px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .2s,transform .22s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-btn-outline:hover{background:var(--accent,#e5efdf)}.ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ring,#2f6b47)}.ds-btn-outline:active{transform:scale(.97)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Form field with sage stroke and za'atar focus ring.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"admin@example.com\" />",
      "css": ".ds-input{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:280px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;background:var(--background,#f3f5ef);color:var(--foreground,#17251b);border:1px solid var(--input,#c6d0bf);border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;caret-color:var(--terracotta,#b8861a);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0/.05);transition:border-color .18s,box-shadow .22s}.ds-input::placeholder{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted-foreground,#536253) 80%,transparent)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring,#2f6b47);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring,#2f6b47) 30%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dashboard Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "White card with gold-mark icon title and hairline rows.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><header class=\"ds-card-h\"><h2><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><path d=\"M14 14h7v7h-7z\"/></svg>Tables &amp; QR</h2><a href=\"#\">Open</a></header><dl><div class=\"ds-row\"><dt>Active tables</dt><dd>16 / 18</dd></div><div class=\"ds-row\"><dt>With QR</dt><dd>14</dd></div><div class=\"ds-row\"><dt>Without QR</dt><dd class=\"warn\">4</dd></div></dl></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:340px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--card-foreground,#17251b);border:1px solid var(--border,#dce3d5);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px 0 rgb(23 37 27/6%),0 12px 28px -16px rgb(23 37 27/22%)}.ds-card-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px}.ds-card-h h2{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-card-h svg{color:var(--terracotta,#b8861a)}.ds-card-h a{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--primary,#24553a);text-decoration:none}.ds-card-h a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-card dl{margin:0}.ds-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#dce3d5);padding:10px 0;font-size:14px}.ds-row:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}.ds-row dt{color:var(--muted-foreground,#536253)}.ds-row dd{margin:0;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-row dd.warn{color:var(--warning,#9a6205)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Za'atar rail: section head with spice-hue icon, items with hue marker on the active row.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><div class=\"ds-rail-head\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8cc79a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"m16 2-2.3 2.3a3 3 0 0 0 0 4.2l1.8 1.8a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 0L22 8\"/><path d=\"M15 15 3.3 3.3a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 0 6l7.3 7.3c.7.7 2 .7 2.8 0L15 15Zm0 0 7 7\"/><path d=\"m2.1 21.8 6.4-6.3\"/><path d=\"m19 5-7 7\"/></svg>Menu</div><a class=\"ds-rail-item is-active\" href=\"#\" style=\"--hue:#8cc79a\"><span class=\"mk\"></span>Categories</a><a class=\"ds-rail-item\" href=\"#\">Menu items</a><a class=\"ds-rail-item\" href=\"#\">Ingredients</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:248px;padding:8px;background:var(--sidebar-background,#1c3526);border-radius:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.ds-rail-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sidebar-strong,#f4f7ee)}.ds-rail-item{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;height:40px;padding:0 12px 0 43px;border-radius:14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--sidebar-foreground,#c3d3c1);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .15s,color .3s}.ds-rail-item:hover{background:rgba(233,245,220,.054);color:var(--sidebar-strong,#f4f7ee)}.ds-rail-item:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--sidebar-ring,#e0b23a)}.ds-rail-item.is-active{background:var(--sidebar-accent,rgba(233,245,220,.09));color:var(--sidebar-strong,#f4f7ee);font-weight:600}.ds-rail-item .mk{position:absolute;inset-block:8px;inset-inline-start:0;width:3px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--hue)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sufra Plate",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "plate",
      "description": "A category as a glazed plate: outer za'atar ring = 3D share, inner gold ring = photo share; opens the category's items missing 3D.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-plate\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" width=\"104\" height=\"104\" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgb(8 20 12/.35))\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"57\" fill=\"#f6f2e7\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e4a8c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\".85\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"51\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b8f9a\" stroke-width=\".8\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e4ddcc\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ece6d8\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#24553a\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"276.5\" stroke-dashoffset=\"118.9\" transform=\"rotate(-90 60 60)\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c9951f\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"213.6\" stroke-dashoffset=\"42.7\" transform=\"rotate(-90 60 60)\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#17251b\">7</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#24553a\">57%</text></svg><span class=\"n\">Grills</span><span class=\"s\">3 without 3D</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-plate{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:152px;padding:6px;border-radius:16px;background:#1f3a2a;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-plate svg{transition:transform .3s}.ds-plate:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.ds-plate:hover svg{transform:rotate(8deg)}.ds-plate:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #e0b23a}.ds-plate .n{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#f4f7ee}.ds-plate .s{font-size:12px;color:#f1d68f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Brass Tray",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "sufra-cloth",
      "description": "The tray at the centre of the sufra map carrying the menu-wide 3D share.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cloth\"><div class=\"ds-tray\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"99\" fill=\"#c79a44\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a87c2c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b58a38\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b58a38\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b58a38\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/></svg><div class=\"t\"><b>49%</b><span>3D models</span><small>41 items</small></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cloth{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;place-items:center;width:320px;height:260px;background:#1f3a2a;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px 0 rgb(23 37 27/6%),0 12px 28px -16px rgb(23 37 27/22%)}.ds-tray{position:relative;width:180px;height:180px;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-tray svg{position:absolute;inset:0;filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 18px rgb(8 20 12/.45))}.ds-tray .t{position:relative;text-align:center;color:#2a1f0c;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ds-tray b{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tray span{margin-top:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500}.ds-tray small{margin-top:8px;font-size:12px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Figure Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Hairline-divided linked figures: big tabular numeral, small muted label.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-figs\"><a href=\"#\"><b>6</b><span>Categories</span></a><a href=\"#\"><b>39</b><span>Active items</span></a><a href=\"#\"><b class=\"warn\">20</b><span>Without 3D</span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-figs{font-family:\"Readex Pro\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,120px);overflow:hidden;background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#dce3d5);border-radius:16px}.ds-figs a{margin:-1px 0 0 -1px;border-inline-start:1px solid var(--border,#dce3d5);border-top:1px solid var(--border,#dce3d5);padding:14px 16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .18s}.ds-figs a:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#e5efdf) 60%,transparent)}.ds-figs a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring,#2f6b47) 60%,transparent);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-figs b{display:block;font-size:28px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:var(--foreground,#17251b);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-figs b.warn{color:var(--warning,#9a6205)}.ds-figs span{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#536253)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Sufra",
    "overview": "The console is laid out like a Levantine mezze table seen from above. Za'atar green is the cloth and the rail; herb-white is the daylight surface the work happens on; olive-oil gold marks whatever is active; sumac is kept for alarms. The restaurant's menu is read the way you read a spread: categories are plates, and a plate fills as its dishes gain 3D models and photos.\n\nThe density is an operator's density: white cards on a sage page, hairline rows instead of boxes inside boxes, big tabular numerals with small quiet labels under them. Arabic is the first language and the layout mirrors in RTL; Readex Pro carries both scripts at one weight ramp. Material lives in the signature pieces (the glazed plates, the hammered brass tray, the daylight 3D table on sign-in), not in textures painted onto every surface.\n\nThis world is deliberately not the sibling SuperAdmin console: no espresso rail, no burgundy hero card, no ivory/terracotta ground. Burgundy and the brand ivory appear only on the Shoof logo and its lockup badge, which keep their own identity colours.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Za'atar-green rail and cloth, herb-white work surface, olive-oil gold for active marks.",
      "One spice hue per navigation section for wayfinding.",
      "Categories drawn as glazed plates whose rings show 3D and photo coverage.",
      "Readex Pro throughout; scale contrast between numerals and labels carries hierarchy.",
      "Flat surfaces with one soft card shadow; depth belongs to the plates and tray.",
      "Sign-in is always the daylight (light) set."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Logo Keeps Its Colours Rule",
        "body": "The Shoof mark is always a burgundy tile with ivory plates, in every theme and on every surface. The tile-less mark and wordmark use burgundy on light and ivory on dark. The console palette never re-themes the logo, and burgundy is never used for console UI beyond the lockup's own badge.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Spice Wayfinding Rule",
        "body": "Each navigation section owns one spice hue: za'atar for Menu, turmeric for AI generation, sumac for Restaurant, nigella for Team. The hue marks the section icon and the active row's marker and icon. It is not used as a fill anywhere else.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Gold Marks Rule",
        "body": "Olive-oil gold marks what is active or selected (indicators, carets, row hover, focus on the rail). It is never body text and never a large fill, except as the dark-mode action colour.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Big Number, Small Label Rule",
        "body": "A figure is set large in display weight with tabular numerals; its label sits under it at 0.75rem in the muted colour. Labels never compete with the figure.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Lining Numerals Rule",
        "body": "All numerals are lining; tables and figure rows are tabular. Numbers in mixed-direction strings are isolated LTR.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Hairline Row Rule",
        "body": "Inside a card, related values are separated by hairline rows (top border, 10px vertical padding), never by nested boxes or tile grids.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Objects Carry Depth Rule",
        "body": "The cloth is flat colour. Only things set on it (plates, tray, the 3D dish) are lifted. No faked fabric weave, no gradients standing in for material.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the single motion curve `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` for entrances, rings and the sliding nav pill; interface feedback always animates, and only decorative infinite loops stop under reduced motion.",
      "Do give each navigation section its spice hue, and only on its icon and active marker.",
      "Do separate values inside a card with hairline rows.",
      "Do set figures large and tabular with a small muted label under them.",
      "Do draw scrims and overlays on the cloth in za'atar green, not black.",
      "Do mirror layouts with logical properties (start/end) so Arabic and English share one layout."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't re-theme the Shoof logo, and don't use its burgundy, or the SuperAdmin console's espresso and terracotta, for console UI. The plates' ivory glaze is the table's own and stays.",
      "Don't nest boxed tiles inside cards.",
      "Don't fake material with CSS textures or gradients on the cloth; material lives in the plates, tray and 3D scene.",
      "Don't use gold for body text or large fills in light mode.",
      "Don't put small uppercase labels above headings; the date and restaurant name follow the greeting."
    ]
  }
}
